
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Autos en Venta</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #d4edf9;  /* Fondo celeste hermoso 💙 */
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .caja-principal {
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 45px 35px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(49, 130, 206, 0.15);
      text-align: center;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #2b6cb0;
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 45px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .boton {
      display: block;
      background: #3182ce;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .boton:hover {
      background: #2b6cb0;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .boton:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="caja-principal">
    <h1>🚗 Autos en Venta</h1>

    <a href="cargar.html" class="boton">📄 Ingresar Auto</a>
    <a href="ver.html" class="boton">📋 Ver Autos Cargados</a>
    <a href="buscar.html" class="boton">🔍 Buscar Auto</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
